NVD fMRIPrep 25.2.5 final functional derivatives

This directory publishes only the result classes described in the dataset
README: T1w and MNI152NLin2009cAsym preprocessed BOLD NIfTI time series,
fsLR 91k CIFTI time series, left/right fsLR 32k GIFTI time series, confound
tables, and their JSON metadata. There are 20 participants and 34 runs per
participant (33 task runs and one rest run). Original entities are preserved.

No fieldmap/susceptibility distortion correction was applied (--ignore
fieldmaps). The one raw T1w acquisition in ses-101 was used for all functional
sessions; FreeSurfer reconstructions were reused. The original per-run
fMRIPrep anatomical processing and resampling are unchanged. Image contents
are hard-linked from the completed outputs and retain their original SHA256.
TR is 1 s; actual frame counts vary by acquisition. The original StartTime,
spatial references and confound definitions are retained. Initial n/a
confound values are retained. The 91k CIFTI uses fsLR32k cortex and
MNI152NLin6Asym subcortical voxels.

Functional image Sources identify the public raw BOLD and the shared raw
T1w, together with any original public TemplateFlow sources. This curated
release omits intermediate references/transforms, all anatomical derivative
trees, masks, segmentation, native surface outputs, reports, work directories
and scheduler files. The complete computational outputs stay on the processing
server; omitted intermediate paths are not presented as available dataset
Sources. Original raw data and events are unchanged.

Source: OpenNeuro ds007354 snapshot 2.0.5, CC0.
